    "updated_at": "2015-07-17T10:25:17Z",
    "body": "I have the feeling that triggering/loading is relevant for navigating, not necessarily for fetch in general. HTML has a \"source browsing context\" feature. Still, it seems impossible to set client to a useful value so I guess there's some special thing navigate has to do to associate its fetch with the fetch registry. Hmm.\n",
