    "body": "https://groups.google.com/d/msg/mozilla.dev.platform/h9AyKjgCd_4/he_1vwnrOQAJ has notes on how we should solve this. Basically navigation needs to be responsible for creating a \"fetch group\". Workers also need to create one. Then there's also some complicated cases around `object` and `embed` elements.\n",
